      ],
      "text_preview": "In light of his aforesaid submissions, he prays that the notice issued to the petitioners by the investigating officer dated 3rd February, 2024 should be quashed and/or set aside."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "899dc8e5029349dfb336c66cb54c8bca_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAt the outset, it is found that the impugned notice dated 3rd February, 2024 has been issued in connection with investigation undertaken by the Santipur Police Station for investigating the offences under Sections 420/406/272/273/120B of t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a89d91d282fd4a4f93830d21bbd8a01a_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The investigation is at a nascent stage."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9c4074609c0748fd872317aef23f5a0e_27",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Moreover, it would be preposterous to decide the legality of an investigation at the instance of a party who has only been served with a notice under Section 91/160 of the Code to produce certain documents, at the preliminary stage of inves"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9f4fb4b41e1446da977edb37cee57282_28",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further the Court cannot be oblivious to the fact that the case has been initiated not only under the Act of 2006 but also under allied offences of the Indian Penal Code."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "79f36cd090d341f6af4343ae7f1a8bf0_29",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The investigation not been concluded the question of violation of provision of Act of 2006 and its consequences cannot be considered at this stage."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "24d57039dc7c4cd2afb0535bdbc8c5df_30",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe proposition of law relied by the petitioner in Joint Action Committee of Air Line Pilots'\nAssociation of India (ALPAI) (supra) though substantial but does not apply so far as the present case is concerned in view of the facts noted her"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "05a5a85dade7472ba021ef555a9561b7_31",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn light of above discussion, the writ petition falls short of merit."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4d105f85050e45d38164d2636068ed09_32",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAccordingly, the writ petition being W.P.A. 3678 of 2024 stands dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dfc04102378745d5830d237014ec9369_33",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
